  "title": "Girl hit by car becomes ball of light",
  "date": "17 May 2024",
  "content": "I got hit by a car when I was 12. When the paramedics got there, I was DOA. I split my head open. They brought me back with the paddles.\n\nI remember seeing the car coming at me, then a flying sense. Very vivid. I noticed flying because the car hit me and then I was flying into transitioning.\n\nThen I went through a tunnel/portal and everything was bright. I knew what was going on, but I was not scared. I looked down at myself, and I was a ball of light. That didn't scare me either. I was happy and floating around.\n\nThen I saw figures and there were lots of voices speaking but I couldn't understand. Then something grabbed me from behind me and said something else I couldn't understand. When I realized I wasn't a ball of light anymore, I was already waking up in the ambulance.\n\nI felt uncontrollable anger.",
